# A guest punches the bottom box of a stack of ten; the stack falls on both worlds.
scenario stack_punch
scene stack10
seed 3
guests 1
settle 8s

net g1 rtt 60ms jitter 10ms loss 1%

p1 walk 1 0
p1 punch box0 as hit
p0 wait 1s
p0 walk -1.5 1

expect result hit hit
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
expect effects_once
